            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Create Site PSK\n\n\nWhen `usage`==`macs`, corresponding \"macs\" field will hold a list consisting of client MAC addresses ([\"xx:xx:xx:xx:xx\",...]) or mac patterns([\"xx:xx:*\",\"xx*\",...]) or both ([\"xx:xx:xx:xx:xx:xx\", \"xx:*\", ...]). This list is capped at 5000"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "updateSiteMultiplePsks",
