              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Import PSK from CSV file or JSON\n\n## CSV File Format\n```csv\nPSK Import CSV File Format:\nname,ssid,passphrase,usage,vlan_id,mac\nCommon,warehouse,foryoureyesonly,single,35,a31425f31278\nJustin,reception,visible,multi,1002\n```"
